# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit a file with real values (.gitignore already excludes .env*).

# Origin of the Vouch API: absolute http(s) URL, no trailing slash. Read at build time.
# When set, the app calls the same-origin path /api/* and next.config.mjs proxies it to this origin, so the
# httpOnly refresh cookie is first-party and no CORS is needed (docs/api-contract.md, "Same-origin proxy").
# Leave unset to use the in-browser mock API with demo data (the default for local dev, CI and previews).
# Example: http://localhost:5080
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
